    <div class="text-center mb-6 px-6 mx-auto max-w-7xl section-title--light-outer">
      <h2 class="title-section " data-leaf-target letters-slide-down text-split>
        <span class="title-section text-letters-slide"
          >Precision in every cup. Consistency in every pour. <br/>
          That's The Daily Pour.</span
        >
      </h2>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>

<!----------------- WHAT ON THE MENU Slider-------------------->
<section class="whats-on-menu-section menu-section section-spacing">
 
  <div class="menu-decor-dots" aria-hidden="true">
    <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
  </div>
 
  <div class="menu-header">
        <h2 class="title-section-red " data-leaf-target letters-slide-down text-split>
            <span class="title-section  text-letters-slide">What's on the Menu</span>
        </h2>
     <div class="dp-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <p class="menu-subtext">
      A menu built around craft, balance and the rhythm of the day. Coffees pulled with
      intention. Trendy beverages served as a showpiece. Delicacies that change with the season.
    </p>
  </div>
 
  <div class="menu-slider-wrap">
 
    <button type="button" class="menu-nav menu-nav-prev" id="menuPrev" aria-label="Previous menu category">&#8592;</button>
 
    <div class="menu-slider-viewport">
      <div class="menu-track" id="menuTrack">
 
        <article class="menu-card">
          <div class="menu-card-media">
            <img src="/Assets/images/dailypour/center-slider.png" alt="All-Time Classics" />
            <h3 class="menu-card-title">All-Time Classics</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="menu-card-text">
            At The Daily Pour, timeless favourites take centre stage. From a bold Espresso
            and smooth Americano to a velvety Flat White, comforting Cappuccino, and other
            beloved cafe classics, every cup is crafted with precision and consistency.
          </p>
        </article>
 
        <article class="menu-card">
          <div class="menu-card-media">
            <img src="/Assets/images/dailypour/center-slider.png" alt="Speciality Coffees" />
            <h3 class="menu-card-title">Speciality Coffees</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="menu-card-text">
            Explore a curated selection of speciality coffees, from indulgent frappes and
            refreshing cold-foam creations to signature espresso-based beverages. Crafted by
            trained baristas using carefully selected beans, each cup is designed to deliver
            a distinctive and elevated coffee experience.
          </p>
        </article>
 
        <article class="menu-card">
          <div class="menu-card-media">
            <img src="/Assets/images/dailypour/center-slider.png" alt="Trendy Beverages" />
            <h3 class="menu-card-title">Trendy Beverages</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="menu-card-text">
            Stay refreshed with our collection of contemporary beverage favourites, crafted
            for consumers who enjoy discovering the latest trends in cafe culture. From classic
            iced teas with a refreshing twist and vibrant boba poppers to our signature cold
            matcha range and indulgent cold foam creations, every drink is designed to be as
            exciting as it is delicious.
          </p>
        </article>
 
        <article class="menu-card">
          <div class="menu-card-media">
            <img src="/Assets/images/dailypour/center-slider.png" alt="Bakery Pastries" />
            <h3 class="menu-card-title">Bakery Pastries</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="menu-card-text">
            Drawn from TajSATS' culinary expertise, our curated bakery menu offers an
            all-day selection of freshly baked breads, sandwiches, savouries and delicate
            pastries, each one crafted to be savoured alongside your favourite cup.
          </p>
        </article>
                <article class="menu-card">
          <div class="menu-card-media">
            <img src="/Assets/images/dailypour/center-slider.png" alt="Bakery Pastries" />
            <h3 class="menu-card-title">Bakery Pastries</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="menu-card-text">
            Drawn from TajSATS' culinary expertise, our curated bakery menu offers an
            all-day selection of freshly baked breads, sandwiches, savouries and delicate
            pastries, each one crafted to be savoured alongside your favourite cup.
          </p>
        </article>
                <article class="menu-card">
          <div class="menu-card-media">
            <img src="/Assets/images/dailypour/center-slider.png" alt="Bakery Pastries" />
            <h3 class="menu-card-title">Bakery Pastries</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="menu-card-text">
            Drawn from TajSATS' culinary expertise, our curated bakery menu offers an
            all-day selection of freshly baked breads, sandwiches, savouries and delicate
            pastries, each one crafted to be savoured alongside your favourite cup.
          </p>
        </article>
 
      </div>
    </div>
 
    <button type="button" class="menu-nav menu-nav-next" id="menuNext" aria-label="Next menu category">&#8594;</button>
 
  </div>
 
</section>

<!----------------- CEnter FOCUESED SLDIER-------------------->
<section class="daily-pour-experience-section experience-section section-spacing">
 
  <div class="experience-header">
            <h2 class="title-section-red " data-leaf-target letters-slide-down text-split>
            <span class="title-section  text-letters-slide">The Daily Pour Experience</span>
        </h2>

         <div class="dp-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <p class="experience-subtext">
      The Daily Pour is not just about what is in the cup. It is about how the moment is made.
      A quiet pause built into a busy day. A small ritual you can count on.
    </p>
   
   
      <span class="experience-divider-line"></span>
      <img class="experience-divider-icon" src="Assets/images/common-images/coffee-bean-icon.svg" alt="" />
      <span class="experience-divider-line"></span>
    </div>

  </div>
 
  <div class="experience-slider-viewport" id="experienceViewport">
    <div class="experience-track" id="experienceTrack">
 
      <div class="experience-slide" data-index="0">
        <img src="/Assets/images/dailypour/center-slider.png" alt="A warm cafe corner with coffee and candlelight" />
        <div class="experience-caption">
          <h3 class="experience-caption-title">A Warm Welcome</h3>
          <p class="experience-caption-text">
            Every corner is designed to slow you down for a moment, with warm light,
            honest materials and the quiet comfort of a well-made cup nearby.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
 
      <div class="experience-slide" data-index="1">
        <img src="/Assets/images/dailypour/center-slider.png" alt="Barista pouring latte art into a blue ceramic cup" />
        <div class="experience-caption">
          <h3 class="experience-caption-title">Crafted with Care</h3>
          <p class="experience-caption-text">
            Every drink is prepared by trained baristas, every recipe is documented
            and every cup is served with the small touches that turn each sip into
            a moment. Craft is what separates a great coffee from a good one.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
 
      <div class="experience-slide" data-index="2">
        <img src="/Assets/images/dailypour/center-slider.png" alt="Outdoor cafe seating area" />
        <div class="experience-caption">
          <h3 class="experience-caption-title">Made for the Moment</h3>
          <p class="experience-caption-text">
            Whether it's a five-minute break or a lingering catch-up, every seat
            is set up to make the pause feel intentional, not rushed.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
 
    </div>
  </div>
 
  <div class="experience-controls">
    <button type="button" class="experience-arrow" id="experiencePrev" aria-label="Previous">&#8592;</button>
    <div class="experience-dots" id="experienceDots"></div>
    <button type="button" class="experience-arrow" id="experienceNext" aria-label="Next">&#8594;</button>
  </div>
 
</section>

